{"If the admin leaves the Host field blank, before_validation will attempt to call sub! on nil, raising NoMethodError and returning a 500 instead of a validation error": 0.768795907497406, "Both the update and destroy actions assume the requested embeddable host exists, and if a stale or invalid id hits either endpoint, it will raise NoMethodError and return a 500 instead of a clean 404/422": 0.9219639301300049, "EmbeddableHost.record_for_host compares lower(host) with the host extracted from the URI, but the right-hand side isn't downcased, so embeds with mixed-case referrers are rejected even though DNS is case-insensitive": 0.9329042434692383}